# bundle.json records the SHA-256 of every packaged file and TEKSHIRISH verifies
# it byte for byte on the user's computer, so git must never rewrite line
# endings on commit or checkout — not even with core.autocrlf on Windows.
# Line endings are an editor concern: see .editorconfig (LF, except *.bat CRLF).
* -text

# Third-party and generated binaries: no diffs, no merges.
*.exe  binary
*.dll  binary
*.pyd  binary
*.cat  binary
*.zip  binary
*.ico  binary
*.xlsx binary
app/bin/ffmpeg  binary
app/bin/ffprobe binary
